                        "entry_id": "ea5c387d-d9e9-3cd1-b4e0-d5acaaf5df25",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A pancake, especially a savory one."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "47de114b-45fa-4108-bb8e-bd666752b3ae",
                                "sense_id": "13cb7121-840b-3045-8fa1-0ce6bbed3a4f",
                                "text": "On board they ate unleavened bread cooked on a hot stone or a griddler, pancakes of yellow flour set in hot cinders and all manner of chestnut cakes cooked between two red-hot stones – dishes strongly and highly spiced with garlic […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "62c45f02-582f-492d-843a-86d42d2c6de3",
                                "sense_id": "13cb7121-840b-3045-8fa1-0ce6bbed3a4f",
                                "text": "He wiped his plate with a griddler."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "de630717-ee5b-4551-95ee-a3bcf95dff30",
                                "sense_id": "13cb7121-840b-3045-8fa1-0ce6bbed3a4f",
                                "text": "A deep Hispanic voice uttered the words I wanted to hear. “A griddler and coffee for you and a bear claw for me.·"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
